    "description": "Welcome Home to Cole Valley! This charming two-unit property with a bonus space below is perfectly located in the heart of Cole Valley. Ideal for both owner-occupants and investors, the property will be delivered with one unit vacant and the other generating rental income. Enjoy a large, fenced-in backyard perfect for gardening, barbecuing, or simply soaking up the sun. You're just a few blocks from Kezar Stadium and directly across the street from Golden Gate Park, with a variety of restaurants, boutiques, bars, and grocery stores all within easy walking distance.  The top unit features two bedrooms, a bright and airy bonus attic space, and one-and-a-half bathrooms. The lower unit offers one bedroom plus an office and a fabulous private deck off the back. On the ground level, a versatile bonus space awaits ideal for a guest room, home gym, or additional office. The property also includes one-car interior parking. This is a rare opportunity to own a flexible, well-located property that truly checks all the boxes."
  },
